{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a28f4d28-1e22-857b-84cc-5747c4440b76",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:55:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:51:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. I'm calling about a pothole. It's at the intersection near my house, at 33 Dixon Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty-three Dixon Street, okay. North End, right? And the pothole's right at the intersection, not out front of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the intersection. Not out front of the house. It's where Dixon meets the cross street, and it's been patched three times now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three times. Wow. So somebody's filled it and it keeps opening back up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Keeps opening back up. Yes. They patch it, and within a couple of weeks it's a hole again. The last patch was maybe two weeks ago and it's already breaking apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me write that down. Pothole, Dixon intersection, patched three times, failing again. How big would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How big. Um, maybe a foot and a half across? And deep enough that a car drops into it. I'd say a few inches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A foot and a half, few inches deep. Got it. Anything else about the spot I should note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's on a bus route. The bus goes right over it, and it bangs pretty hard every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On a bus route. That's good to know, I'll put that in the notes. That can move it up a bit, since the buses are hammering it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Moves it up. Good. Because the patches just aren't holding."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sounds like it needs more than a cold patch. I'll flag it for the crew supervisor so they look at the base, not just fill it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Look at the base. Okay. I'm sorry, I'm a little scattered today. It's our anniversary this weekend and my head's somewhere else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, congratulations. No worries, you've given me everything I need. Let me get this entered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Could I get a reference number for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on a second while it saves. [pause] Okay, your request number is P-W, 2-6, 0-3-0-2, 1-1. Want me to read that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please. P-W, 2-6, then what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P-W, dash, 2-6, dash, 0-3-0-2, dash, 1-1."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P-W, 2-6, 0-3-0-2, 1-1. Okay, I have that written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want a call back when the crew's been out? I have a number here for you, ending in 0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ending in 0183. Yes, that's the landline. That's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, I'll note it. Someone should check the spot within the next week or so, depending on how the schedule looks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Within the next week or so. Okay. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Nancy. Enjoy the anniversary."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Bye now."
    }
  ],
